<attribute name="name" nodeId="e88cc9c8">Define reporting requirements</attribute>
<attribute name="guid" nodeId="1c32e8bc">_2Azq8MarEeSZS6zUrl8OeQ</attribute>
<attribute name="presentationName" nodeId="21f90cfc">Define reporting requirements</attribute>
<attribute name="briefDescription" nodeId="11c4c366"></attribute>
<attribute name="suppressed" nodeId="3b44d255">false</attribute>
<attribute name="orderingGuide" nodeId="52be9679"></attribute>
<attribute name="variabilityType" nodeId="f8cb2904">na</attribute>
<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="acffd75e"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="e8fb59a3">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define the reporting requirements for the project. 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Reporting requirements include the following: 
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Type of information required for each recipient
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Frequency of the reporting
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Medium (e.g., written, oral)
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Special considerations
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Considerations include deviations from plans that fall outside the normal scope of periodic reports. These
        deviations may be too important or urgent to be tabled until the next periodic report is issued.
    &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review the reporting requirements with each of the recipients to confirm that their needs are met.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
